# Build-time defaults for a production build run outside Vercel.
#
# Vercel's own Environment Variables take precedence, and they are what the
# deployed site actually uses — this file is the fallback for `npm run build`
# on a machine that has none set.
#
# Tracked deliberately: neither value is a secret. VITE_* is inlined into the
# bundle at build time and served to every visitor, so nothing secret can ever
# go in this file. The Razorpay key id is the publishable key — the one the
# checkout widget needs in the browser. The key *secret* lives only on the
# server. Anything confidential belongs in .env.local, which is gitignored.
#
# Previously pointed at https://make-my-trip-wb8n.onrender.com — a Render
# service that still answers /health but 404s every API route, because it runs
# pre-main code whose initialisation failed after the port opened. A build
# picking this up produced a site where nothing worked and nothing said why.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://make-my-trip-api-roan.vercel.app/api/v1
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_TLbtkJXOyFUAov
